
### 1. Raise Dispute (CAR_OWNER JWT)
POST http:loc/leads/{{leadId}}/dispute
Authorization: Bearer {{carOwnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Shop did not fix the issue properly"
}

### Expected: 201, lead status = DISPUTED, FCM sent to shop + admin

### 2. Get Dispute by Lead (any party)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}/dispute
Authorization: Bearer {{carOwnerToken}}

### Expected: 200, status = OPEN, raisedByName filled

### 3. Get All Disputes (ADMIN JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/disputes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Expected: 200, list with our dispute

### 4. Resolve Dispute (ADMIN JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/disputes/{{disputeId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resolution": "RESOLVED_SHOP",
  "adminNote": "Shop provided valid proof of work"
}

### Expected: 200, status = RESOLVED_SHOP
###           lead status = COMPLETED
###           FCM sent to both parties